      "content": "hey... i've been having these really weird moments where i just get super confused out of nowhere. like i'll be in the middle of a sentence and just completely lose my train of thought or can't find simple words. i also noticed my left hand feels kind of tingly/numb for a minute when it happens. i've been working a lot lately and maybe just not sleeping enough, so do u think it's just intense brain fog or something?",
